# PSR-6c6b — Durable Harbor E2E harness

## Intent

Close **G-SEED-E2E-HARNESS** from PSR-6c6 by landing a **parallel** durable
server harness + Playwright config — without running live E2E and without
changing the default seed smoke.

| Path | Script / config | Seed |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Default (CERT historical / local fixture) | `smoke-marketing-harbor-e2e-servers.mjs` + `playwright.marketing-harbor.config.ts` | forced `1` + memory |
| Durable (live pack when YES) | `smoke-marketing-harbor-durable-e2e-servers.mjs` + `playwright.marketing-harbor-durable.config.ts` | forbidden |

## Commands

```bash
# Contract-only (no servers):
HARBOR_DURABLE_E2E_DRY_RUN=1 \
  DATABASE_URL=postgresql://app_tour:app_tour@127.0.0.1:5434/tour_db \
  DATABASE_URL_ADMIN=postgresql://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5434/tour_db \
  node apps/marketing/scripts/smoke-marketing-harbor-durable-e2e-servers.mjs

# Ratchet:
node scripts/ops/psr-6c6b-harbor-durable-e2e-harness-smoke.mjs

# Live Playwright (Architect YES only):
# PW_NO_REUSE_SERVER=1 pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run test:smoke:harbor:durable
```

## Still required before CERT-03 durable

1. Architect YES
2. Disposable Postgres + migrations
3. Published Harbor tour for smoke tenant
4. Process restart + RLS packs (6c5 families)

## Next

`PSR-8c0-governance-templates` or Architect YES execute.
